        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 1920,
        "paragraph_id": "2C0B7764",
        "text": "In (C.13) the pressure term plpf  is the surface water pressure at the bed, which in the case of non-hydrostatic surface water flow is high-pass filtered at 4/Trep, the superscript n corresponds to the time step number and Δt is the size of the time step. The infiltration rate in the coupled relationship can be solved through substitution:"
      }
